{"seq":2,"slug":"certification-chain-of-custody","title":"认证机构、认可体系与产销监管链（Chain of Custody）模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/eco-label-certification-taxonomy/certification-chain-of-custody","wordCount":2964,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"认证机构-认可体系与产销监管链-chain-of-custody-模型\">认证机构、认可体系与产销监管链（Chain of Custody）模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-三层信任结构与一条不断裂的监管链\">核心概念：三层信任结构与一条不断裂的监管链</h2><p>生态标签不是「印在包装上的一个图形」，而是一条从<strong>标准制定者</strong>到<strong>最终商品</strong>的信任传递链。跨境电商把它当作准入材料提交时，真正需要回答的是三个彼此独立的问题：谁定义了标准、谁有资格判定符合性、以及被认证的工序属性究竟有没有跟着货物一路走到成品。对应到体系结构就是三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>英文对应</th>\n<th>关键资质文件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准层</td>\n<td>标准所有者 / 方案所有者（Scheme Owner）</td>\n<td>Standard Setter / Scheme Owner</td>\n<td>标准文本、方案规则（Scheme Rules）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认可层</td>\n<td>认可机构（Accreditation Body）</td>\n<td>Accreditation Body</td>\n<td>认可证书 + 认可范围（Scope）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>认证层</td>\n<td>认证机构（Certification Body, CB）</td>\n<td>Conformity Assessment Body</td>\n<td>认证证书 + 产销监管链（CoC）证书</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>关键认知</strong>：认可（accreditation）不是认证（certification）。认可机构对<strong>认证机构</strong>的能力做背书，认证机构对<strong>企业/产品</strong>做背书。跨境卖家手上拿到的通常是第三层证书，而平台合规系统若只校验第三层，就会漏掉「这家 CB 本身是否被有效认可、其认可范围是否覆盖该标准」这一致命前提 —— 一张由无认可资质机构签发的证书，在法规层面等同于废纸。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    S[方案所有者&lt;br/&gt;Scheme Owner] --&gt;|发布标准与方案规则| CB[认证机构 CB]&#10;    AB[认可机构 AB] --&gt;|认可并限定 Scope| CB&#10;    IAF[国际互认体系&lt;br/&gt;IAF MLA / EA MLA] --&gt;|多边互认| AB&#10;    CB --&gt;|证书 + CoC 证书| H[持证组织&lt;br/&gt;工厂/贸易商/品牌]&#10;    H --&gt;|货物随附交易证明| M[市场 / 平台 / 海关]&#10;    M --&gt;|验证请求| R[证书数据库&lt;br/&gt;registry / blockchain]&#10;    R --&gt;|查询 CB+证书号| CB\">flowchart TD\n    S[方案所有者&lt;br/&gt;Scheme Owner] --&gt;|发布标准与方案规则| CB[认证机构 CB]\n    AB[认可机构 AB] --&gt;|认可并限定 Scope| CB\n    IAF[国际互认体系&lt;br/&gt;IAF MLA / EA MLA] --&gt;|多边互认| AB\n    CB --&gt;|证书 + CoC 证书| H[持证组织&lt;br/&gt;工厂/贸易商/品牌]\n    H --&gt;|货物随附交易证明| M[市场 / 平台 / 海关]\n    M --&gt;|验证请求| R[证书数据库&lt;br/&gt;registry / blockchain]\n    R --&gt;|查询 CB+证书号| CB</pre><p>链上任何一环断裂，标签声明即不成立。工程视角的核心问题因此变成：<strong>如何把「链」建模成可查询、可验证、且能沿批次传递的数据结构</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"认可体系-iso-iec-17065-iaf-mla-与认可范围\">认可体系：ISO/IEC 17065、IAF MLA 与认可范围</h2><p>认证机构要合法签发产品符合性证书，必须依据 <strong>ISO/IEC 17065</strong>（《合格评定 —— 对提供产品、过程和服务认证的机构的要求》）获得认可，它规定 CB 的<strong>能力要求</strong>：公正性管理、人员能力、认证决定与评价分离、申诉投诉处理、信息公开。与之并列的还有 ISO/IEC 17021（管理体系认证，如 ISO 14001 EMS）与 ISO/IEC 17025（检测实验室）。生态标签场景里，<strong>产品级标签 = 17065</strong>，而支撑它的实验室数据往往来自 <strong>17025</strong> 实验室 —— 两者必须分别核验。</p>\n<p>认可机构（AB）在认可 CB 时签发一份<strong>认可范围（Scope of Accreditation）</strong>，逐条列明该 CB 被授权开展哪些标准、产品类别与活动，典型维度包括：标准编号（如 FSC-STD-40-004、EU Ecolabel、GRS 4.0）、认证模式（产品 / 体系 / CoC）、产品技术领域（纺织品、食品、木制品）与地理位置。<strong>验收证书时的第一动作不是看证书本身，而是核对 CB 的认可范围是否覆盖该标准与该产品类别</strong>。常见失效模式是：CB 具备欧盟生态标签（EU Ecolabel）认可，却未扩展到某个新增产品组（Product Group），为该产品组签发的证书便超出了认可边界。</p>\n<p>认可范围之上还有<strong>多边互认（MLA / MRA）</strong>。IAF（International Accreditation Forum）MLA 让成员认可机构互相承认彼此的认可结果，因而由具备 IAF MLA 的 AB 所认可的 CB 签发的证书在全球被同等接受；区域层面有 EA、IAAC、APAC 等组织与 IAF 形成层级互认。对跨境电商的含义是：<strong>判断一张证书「国际通用」的快捷方式，是看签发 CB 的认可方是否在 IAF MLA 签署方名录内</strong>。反之，某些国家或买家会强制指定本国有资质的 AB，此时 MLA 也不豁免本地注册义务。一张完整的准入材料因此至少含四类文件：认可证书 + Scope、产品认证证书、场地级 CoC 证书（如 FSC-STD-40-004）、ISO/IEC 17025 实验室检测报告。</p>\n<h2 id=\"产销监管链的四类模型-从-identity-preserved-到-book-and-claim\">产销监管链的四类模型：从 Identity Preserved 到 Book and Claim</h2><p>当认证对象不是「一件成品」而是「一种可持续属性」（如再生材料含量、认证木材、有机棉），属性必须在多道加工与贸易环节间<strong>被跟踪并可与物理货物分离</strong>。产销监管链方案通常提供四种渐进的模型，按「物理隔离强度」递减、按「体系灵活度」递增排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>核心规则</th>\n<th>属性与货物关系</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同一性保持</td>\n<td>Identity Preserved (IP)</td>\n<td>认证物料全程物理隔离并可溯源到单一来源</td>\n<td>强绑定，可追溯到批次/农场</td>\n<td>高端有机、单一产地认证木</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理隔离</td>\n<td>Segregated (SG)</td>\n<td>认证物料与非认证物料物理隔离，允许混合同类认证源</td>\n<td>绑定到「认证池」，非单一来源</td>\n<td>认证棉花、棕榈油（部分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量平衡</td>\n<td>Mass Balance (MB)</td>\n<td>允许认证与非认证物料混合，按<strong>账目比例</strong>记账</td>\n<td>账目绑定，物理不绑定</td>\n<td>棕榈油、可可、生物基材料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账面声明</td>\n<td>Book and Claim (B&amp;C)</td>\n<td>认证凭证与物理货物<strong>完全脱钩</strong>，可交易</td>\n<td>完全不绑定</td>\n<td>绿电证书、可持续航空燃料</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>质量平衡（MB）<strong>是最容易被误解的模型：设施在投入端分配认证物料的账目额度，产出端在额度范围内对一部分产出声明认证，但</strong>不保证被声明的那批货物物理上含认证原料</strong>。设某周期投入认证原料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、期初结余 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则产出端可声明额度上限为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{claim} \\le b_0 + m_c, \\qquad b_1 = b_0 + m_c - Q_{claim}, \\quad b_1 \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期末结转额度，必须非负 —— 这是 MB 的核心不变量：<strong>账目不能透支</strong>。工程上它是一个带期初余额的库存守恒方程，计量单位是「认证属性」而非实物数量。MB 与 SG 的差别就在是否允许两类物料物理共线加工：MB 允许，SG 不允许。<strong>Book and Claim</strong> 则凭证与实物完全分离、可单独交易与注销，能覆盖电网这类无法物理追踪的载体，代价是只能声明「等量贡献」，误用会带来虚假声明（greenwashing）风险。四类模型的选择由<strong>方案所有者</strong>规定，不能由企业自选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区块链与数字凭证-把监管链变成可验证数据\">区块链与数字凭证：把监管链变成可验证数据</h2><p>传统 CoC 依赖纸质「交易证明（Transaction Certificate）」与人工台账，跨境场景下其弱点被放大：单据真伪难辨、跨机构查询靠邮件、批次篡改无法察觉。近年的工程实践把监管链推向<strong>数字可验证凭证（Verifiable Credential, VC）<strong>与分布式账本：把每一笔物料转移建模为一条</strong>不可变交易记录</strong>，验证方通过密码学签名与哈希链确认其未被篡改。以再生材料含量认证（Textile Exchange 的 GRS / RCS）与森林认证（FSC）为例，数字化大体经历三种实现：中心化数据库 + 在线验证（如 FSC 公开证书数据库，门槛低但依赖数据同步）、分布式账本（DLT）追踪（每笔交易哈希链接前一笔，适合跨多组织长链）、以及可验证凭证 + 数字产品护照（欧盟《可持续产品生态设计法规》ESPR 推动的产品级数字凭证）。一条交易记录至少携带 <code>transaction_id</code>、<code>prev_tx_hash</code>、<code>from_entity</code>、<code>to_entity</code>、<code>product_attributes</code>、<code>model</code>、<code>certificate_ref</code>、时间戳与签名；<strong>验证即沿全部祖先交易回溯，逐笔核对签名有效、CB 证书在交易时点有效、且账目守恒</strong> —— 证书有效性必须在交易时点求值，而非以「今天是否过期」一刀切。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[原料场&lt;br/&gt;CoC: FSC 40-004] --&gt;|tx1: 认证木 100t| B[加工厂&lt;br/&gt;MB 模型]&#10;    B --&gt;|tx2: 成品 60t&lt;br/&gt;claim 45t 认证| C[贸易商]&#10;    C --&gt;|tx3: 出口批次| D[品牌/平台]&#10;    D --&gt; E{回溯验证}&#10;    E --&gt;|逐笔验签 + 账目守恒| F[声明成立]&#10;    E --&gt;|任一环签名失效/证书过期| G[声明不成立]\">flowchart LR\n    A[原料场&lt;br/&gt;CoC: FSC 40-004] --&gt;|tx1: 认证木 100t| B[加工厂&lt;br/&gt;MB 模型]\n    B --&gt;|tx2: 成品 60t&lt;br/&gt;claim 45t 认证| C[贸易商]\n    C --&gt;|tx3: 出口批次| D[品牌/平台]\n    D --&gt; E{回溯验证}\n    E --&gt;|逐笔验签 + 账目守恒| F[声明成立]\n    E --&gt;|任一环签名失效/证书过期| G[声明不成立]</pre><h2 id=\"证书与范围的校验算法\">证书与范围的校验算法</h2><p>把上述结构固化成一条可测试的验证流水线，是合规系统真正要交付的东西。核心是<strong>五个必须同时成立的判定</strong>，缺一即整体不通过：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>CB 资质判定</strong>：签发机构在签发时点持有效认可，且其认可 <strong>Scope</strong> 覆盖「证书所依据的标准 + 该产品类别」。</li>\n<li><strong>证书有效性判定</strong>：证书在<strong>声明/交易发生时点</strong>处于有效期内，且未被暂停（suspended）、撤销（withdrawn）或过期。</li>\n<li><strong>持证身份判定</strong>：证书上的组织名称/地址与申报主体一致（含场地级 CoC 证书对<strong>具体场地</strong>的绑定）。</li>\n<li><strong>监管链完整性判定</strong>：沿 CoC 交易的祖先链回溯，签名与哈希链无断裂，账目守恒不变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_1 \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 处处成立。</li>\n<li><strong>声明一致性判定</strong>：标签声明的属性类型（如「含 X% 再生材料」）与所用模型及账目额度一致，措辞合规。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>设证书 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的认可范围集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、目标标准与产品类别为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(std, cat)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、有效区间为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_s, t_e)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、交易时点为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则 CB 层与证书层的联合通过条件可写为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>pass</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>status</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>active</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pass}(c, t) \\iff (std, cat) \\in S_c \\;\\wedge\\; t \\in [t_s, t_e) \\;\\wedge\\; \\text{status}(c, t) = \\text{active}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6542em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">active</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>status</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{status}(c,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">status</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>时点函数</strong>而非当前状态：一张今天已被撤销的证书，对<strong>撤销之前</strong>发生的交易依然有效，若用「当前状态」回溯校验历史批次，会错误地判定合规历史货物不合规。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判定层</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>常见失败原因</th>\n<th>校验方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CB 资质</td>\n<td>IAF/EA/APAC 名录、AB 认可范围公报</td>\n<td>CB 无该标准认可、范围未扩展至该产品组</td>\n<td>名录比对 + Scope 文本解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>证书有效性</td>\n<td>方案所有者证书数据库</td>\n<td>过期、暂停未同步、证书号伪造</td>\n<td>数据库 API / 在线验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持证身份</td>\n<td>证书正文、企业注册信息</td>\n<td>场地地址不符、品牌方与持证方混淆</td>\n<td>场地级匹配 + 别名归一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管链完整性</td>\n<td>CoC 交易台账 / DLT</td>\n<td>单据缺失、账目透支、模型误用</td>\n<td>祖先链回溯 + 守恒校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声明一致性</td>\n<td>标签文本、方案声明规则</td>\n<td>MB 声明写成 IP 措辞、比例超额度</td>\n<td>规则引擎比对声明模板</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值在于把「认证审核」从人工判断拆成五个可独立单测与独立监控的数据判定。任一判定失败应产出<strong>具体的失败原因码</strong>（而非笼统的「证书无效」），因为补救动作完全不同：CB 范围不足要换机构，证书过期要续证，账目透支要核查台账，声明不符要改标签文案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工程落地时，一个 CoC 校验模块应暴露两个正交契约：<code>resolve_cb_scope(cert, as_of) -&gt; scope_set</code> 与 <code>verify_chain(product_batch, as_of) -&gt; {valid, breaks[]}</code>，前者管认可层静态判定，后者管监管链动态回溯。数据侧需要三类最小存储：认可与证书主数据（含 Scope）、CoC 交易台账（append-only）、声明模板库，均以证书号或交易号为不可变主键。</p>\n<p>要点回顾：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>生态标签是<strong>三层信任链</strong>：方案所有者定义标准，认可机构（ISO/IEC 17011，依据 ISO/IEC 17065）认可 CB，CB 签发证书与 CoC 证书；三者必须分别核验。</li>\n<li>认可有<strong>范围（Scope）</strong>，验收第一动作是核对 CB 认可范围是否覆盖该标准<strong>与</strong>产品类别，而非只看证书本身。</li>\n<li>产销监管链有<strong>四类模型</strong> IP / SG / MB / B&amp;C，灵活度递增、物理绑定递减；模型由方案所有者规定，不可自选。</li>\n<li>MB 的核心不变量是账目守恒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_1 \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，等价于带期初余额的库存方程，计量单位是认证属性。</li>\n<li>数字化方向是<strong>可验证凭证 + 分布式账本 + 数字产品护照</strong>；证书状态是<strong>时点函数</strong>（as-of），用「今天是否过期」回溯历史会误判合规货物。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"认证机构、认可体系与产销监管链（Chain of Custody）模型","id":"认证机构-认可体系与产销监管链-chain-of-custody-模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三层信任结构与一条不断裂的监管链","id":"核心概念-三层信任结构与一条不断裂的监管链"},{"level":2,"text":"认可体系：ISO/IEC 17065、IAF MLA 与认可范围","id":"认可体系-iso-iec-17065-iaf-mla-与认可范围"},{"level":2,"text":"产销监管链的四类模型：从 Identity Preserved 到 Book and Claim","id":"产销监管链的四类模型-从-identity-preserved-到-book-and-claim"},{"level":2,"text":"区块链与数字凭证：把监管链变成可验证数据","id":"区块链与数字凭证-把监管链变成可验证数据"},{"level":2,"text":"证书与范围的校验算法","id":"证书与范围的校验算法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生态标签体系分类与准入效力（I/II/III 型与强制/自愿）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/eco-label-certification-taxonomy/ecolabel-scheme-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"标签互认与跨市场准入映射矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/eco-label-certification-taxonomy/label-mutual-recognition-mapping"}}